---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true">// </span>digital accessibility · public sector &amp; healthcare</p>
    <h1 id="hero-h">Find the barriers. Document them. Fix them.</h1>
    <p class="lede">I'm Ethan Christian Flint, a Tier 1 IT Support Center Analyst at the Arizona Supreme Court, building toward digital accessibility work: testing websites and documents against WCAG so people with disabilities can use them. DHS Trusted Tester certification in progress.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/accessibility/">Read the accessibility statement</a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="{{ site.linkedin }}">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="panel" aria-labelledby="conf-h">
    <h2 id="conf-h">conformance: this site</h2>
    <dl class="facts">
      <div><dt>Standard</dt><dd>WCAG 2.2 AA</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Text contrast</dt><dd>AAA (7:1 or higher)</dd></div>
      <div><dt>First full audit</dt><dd>In progress</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Known issues</dt><dd>Published with the audit</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="path-h">
  <h2 id="path-h">Progression</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step step--active">
      <p class="step__status">01 · IN PROGRESS</p>
      <h3>DHS Trusted Tester for Web</h3>
      <p>Modules 1–2 of 6 complete. Exam target: December 2026.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__status">02 · PLANNED</p>
      <h3>Authoring Section 508 Compliant Documents</h3>
      <p>Target: March 2027</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__status">03 · PLANNED</p>
      <h3>IAAP CPACC</h3>
      <p>Target: October 2027</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step">
      <p class="step__status">04 · PREREQUISITES</p>
      <h3>WGU B.S. Business Administration – IT Management</h3>
      <p>Completing prerequisites; enrolling in 2027</p>
    </li>
    <li class="step step--civic">
      <p class="step__status">CIVIC · EXPLORING</p>
      <h3>Chandler boards &amp; commissions</h3>
      <p>Volunteer city board service, with a focus on accessible local government</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="log-h">
  <div class="section__head">
    <h2 id="log-h">Learning log</h2>
    <a href="/log/">All learning log entries</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="entries">
    {%- for entry in collections.log | head(3) %}
    <li>
      <time datetime="{{ entry.date | isoDate }}">{{ entry.date | isoDate }}</time>
      <a href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.data.title }}</a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
